  "goodToKnow": "Das Jahrbuch is a yearbook or annual: das Statistische Jahrbuch, published by the Federal Statistical Office, or academic Jahrbücher for a field. American-style school yearbooks are less common in Germany; instead, graduating Gymnasium students make an Abibuch or Abizeitung with photos and jokes about classmates and teachers. Plural: die Jahrbücher, with umlaut and -er."
